  "problem": "Find the solution $y(t)$ given that the Laplace transform of the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}(t)+y(t)={u}_{3}(t),\\,y(0)=2,\\,{y}^{\u2032}(0)=0,\n$$\n\nis given by\n\n$$\n{s}^{2}Y(s)-2s+Y(s)=\\frac{{e}^{-3s}}{s}.\n$$\n\nThe solution is $y(t)=2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(t)+u(t-3)\\,\\cdot \\,($\n{{field-1}}\n$).$",
